 style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          味：金橘、柚子、黄柠檬\n          <span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Kumquat, Pomelo, Lemon\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这是我们买到的第一支Hamasho水洗，与其它几个新产季的埃塞一样也是很清新的类型；整体偏橘子和柚子的感受，入口后在口中咀嚼拨动咖啡时有一股淡淡的金橘的果味香气，很特别～它的酸感会比Danche多一些，很明快转甜，酸感停留不久，整体都是黄色柑橘水果的感受；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFrs4BmTC4rgRwboiaudQrVCtW3xQuR3Wm4VXeQcv7jiboibVLG7ZiaibibIzicA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 Hamasho\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           Hamasho位于埃塞俄比亚的西达玛区域，Bensa镇，与我们这几年一直卖的圣塔维尼和邦比同属于Daye Bensa公司\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          .哈马修“Hamasho”在西达摩语里是蛇的意思，象征着力量与神灵，\n         </span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          Hamasho与我们一直在售卖的Shantawene，Bombe非常非常的近，他们都依托着Bombe山，可能供应咖啡果给处理站的咖农都有重叠。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFrNS6ibn4GHY93GygoISMSK6Vb0ZR6fUcoU0BCibJrtNic0EDS4ENTbVPtQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"text-align: center;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;\"/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           Daye Bensa由Asefa 和 Mulugeta Dukamo兄弟两于2001年左右创建，立足于自己的家乡Bensa，自己种植，处理并出口咖啡，旗下有16个处理站。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            关于本批次处理方式\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           将咖啡鲜果放入冲洗槽内，捞出浮在水面的未成熟的鲜果，并将筛选后的咖啡鲜果清洗干净，之后放在非洲床上晾晒14-17天\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ReEobaKx9mnXlz48aHcqFrGIvj3zRIibPVsyNLGfC9ASlIUY4XsdpLhTeHkAibrG4NCiayCTzDUCvqg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            关于这只豆子的采购选品\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           23产季时，我们从友商那里拿到我们的第一袋23产季的哈玛修，然后从空运批次一直不活卖到海运批次到港，客户和我们自己都非常的喜欢这个处理站的豆子，当时我写的是“\n           <strong style='white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n            （未来每年能选到应该都会买）”～\n           </strong>\n           今年如愿以偿再次从同渠道买到了2025产季的第一批空运批次，开心！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          额外补充：它和圣塔维尼和邦比来自于\n         </span>\n<strong style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          同一公司，同一片区域哦\n         </strong>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          ！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans G